w: Las ca-rre-tas por de-lan-te, Y los bue-yes por de-trás.
w: Come, let's go to San-ta~A-ni-ta! Come, let's go! for there you'll find
w: In the lead the wag-ons har-nessed, And the ox-en on be-hind.
